61116154121","bead_id":"bob-cli-mg.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-mg[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Period closing balance for WF Checking on period notes[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every week, quarter, ISO-year, and all-time note shows the checking[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]account's exact posted balance at the end of that period (or, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]honestly labeled, as of the last imported day). bob computes the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]balance live from bank evidence, and it is never written into [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]notes. Daily notes stay untouched.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]wf_checking_period_close.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/wf_checking_period_close.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mg[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mg/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Historical balance resolver and check findings[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolver[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolver: add the pure bank/balance.rs resolver (coverage spans, final [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]days, batch attribution, anchor segments, cross-checks, and period [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution) plus the two new `bob bank check` balance findings and their[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs rows, with the invariant test suite.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]balances[] in bob bank report, human line, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]report[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolver[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]report: wire the resolver into `bob bank report` for every period [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector as an additive `balances[]` array and a human Balance line, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then document the Closing balances contract and verify read-only against[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the live vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank Charts header balance readout in bob-ledger-tools[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]readout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]readout: decode `balances[]` and paint the hero's resting BALANCE [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]readout in the Bank Period Charts header, including the header-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]quiet-period state, tooltip, aria, and activation. Update both repos' [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, review preview screenshots, and sync the plugins.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank Closing vocabulary and decision record[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vocabulary[dim] · [dim][/dim]after readout[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vocabulary: apply the accepted memory decisions (Bank Closing glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand, Stats Strip cross-reference, decision record) and republish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mg","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mg.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a0bfb70540d3eb50895d1e1b46903c79","started_at":"2026-11-16T20:47:26.371522+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_